<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Digital Marketing</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #4b0082;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 35px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #222;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        .main {
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            width: 80%;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #4b0082;
        }

        button {
            background-color: #4b0082;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #222;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Digital Marketing</h1>
    <p>Connecting Businesses with Customers Online</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#">Home</a>
    <a href="#">About</a>
    <a href="#">Services</a>
    <a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>

<div class="main">

    <div class="card">
        <h2>What is Digital Marketing?</h2>
        <p>
            Digital marketing is the promotion of products and services
            through digital channels such as search engines, social media,
            websites and email.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Major Areas</h2>
        <p>
            SEO | Social Media Marketing | Content Marketing |
            Email Marketing | Online Advertising
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Why is it Important?</h2>
        <p>
            Digital marketing helps businesses reach a wider audience,
            build relationships with customers and measure their marketing
            performance.
        </p>

        <button>Learn More</button>
    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    <p>Created by Student | 2026</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
